            "level": {
              "value": 2
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your Lion Blade spy training helps you conceal yourself and your identity. You become trained in your choice of Deception or Stealth; if you were already trained in that skill, you become an expert instead. You also gain the Additional Lore skill feat for Espionage Lore. If you were already trained in Espionage Lore, you also become trained in a Lore skill of your choice.\n\nYou never take circumstance penalties for attempting to take a disguise of a different ancestry, age, and so on, as long as the disguised form is appropriate for your size."
            }
          }
        }
